      "value": "Soul Trap"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "A dark and powerful spell that harnesses the essence of life itself. \n\nUpon the target's demise, its the soul is vividly ripped from its corporeal form, seamlessly siphoning its ethereal energy. The departing spirit, ensnared mid-flight, is instead pulled toward their killer, "
        },
        {
          "text": "restoring their magical equipment's charge.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nSuch a spell carries a weighty moral toll, hinting at the precarious balance between mastery over life and death, and the allure of this connection might draw the caster deeper into the shadows of forbidden magic.\n\nSuch callous regard for life can only be wielded by the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead.",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
